                <h3 class="case__name" id="case-07">성산 갈치조림 전문점</h3>
                <p class="case__result">월매출 3,000만원 → 1억 3,000만원</p>
                
              <a class="link-arrow case__link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-todo="video-url">영상 보기<span class="sr-only"> (새 창)</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li class="case reveal" data-filter-item="cases" data-cat="food">
            <article class="case__card" aria-labelledby="case-08">
              <div class="case__media">
                <img class="img-cover ratio-4x3" src="/assets/img/cases/case-08.webp" alt="상호를 흐리게 처리한 월정리 파스타 전문점 외관" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy">
              </div>
              <div class="case__body">
                <div class="case__meta"><ul class="case__tags"><li>파스타 전문점</li><li>월정리</li></ul></div>
                <p class="case__num" aria-hidden="true">08</p>
                <h3 class="case__name" id="case-08">월정리 파스타 전문점</h3>
                <p class="case__result">월매출 1,000만원 미만 → 7,900만원</p>
                <div class="case__desc"><p>테이블 6개 가게입니다.</p></div>
              <a class="link-arrow case__link" href="https://www.instagram.com/p/C1L_hxIPJla/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">영상 보기<span class="sr-only"> (새 창)</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li class="case reveal" data-filter-item="cases" data-cat="food">
            <article class="case__card" aria-labelledby="case-09">
              <div class="case__media">
                <img class="img-cover ratio-4x3" src="/assets/img/cases/case-09.webp" alt="상호를 흐리게 처리한 성산 짬뽕 전문점 외관" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy">
